          "type": null,
          "body": "Can you remove the double negative? That is, change the checkbox to \"Show Legend\" and enable it by default?\n\nhttps://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/win32/uxguide/text-ui#control-labels\nhttps://ux.stackexchange.com/questions/5748/checkbox-label-negating/5779",
