      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 1341695188,
          "type": null,
          "body": "This won't be a problem. I thought about that aswell.\n\nBut \"Show Legend\" does not necessarily show a legend because there are more critia that must be matched for the legend to be shown. This might be confusing.\n\n\"Hide Legend\" on the other side ensures that no legend will be shown.",
